    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26联考）某地城市足球比赛火热，一场比赛票价有三种：预售票10元/张，优待票20元/张，正式票40元/张，已知比赛共售出4万张门票，总收入为90万元，且售出的预售票是优待票数量的一半。问正式票共售出多少张？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "8000"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "9000"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "10000"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "12000"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          36
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          30
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-02-p036.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（三） · 实战精刷2 · 讲义第30页",
            "pdfPage": 36
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先利用预售票是优待票一半，把两种票设为x、2x张，正式票z张。总数3x+z=40000，总收入50x+40z=900000元。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "50x+40(40000-3x)=900000\\Rightarrow70x=700000\\Rightarrow x=10000"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以z=40000-30000=10000张，选C。核验预售10万元、优待40万元、正式40万元，共90万元。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "先用比例减少未知数，再把总数量与总金额联立。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
