    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26北京）连锁便利店26个门店共招聘112名店员，每个门店招3人、5人或6人。已知招3人的门店数是招6人的2倍，则有几个门店招5人？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "5"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "14"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "11"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "8"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          36
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          30
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-03-p036.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（三） · 实战精刷3 · 讲义第30页",
            "pdfPage": 36
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先设招6人的门店有x个，则招3人的有2x个，招5人的有26-3x个。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "6x+3\\times2x+5(26-3x)=112\\Rightarrow130-3x=112\\Rightarrow x=6"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以招5人的有26-18=8个，选D。核验12家招3人、8家招5人、6家招6人，人数36+40+36=112。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "门店数比例先代入，总店数和总人数对应两个不同层次。"
        }
      ],
