    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-04-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第4题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-04",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（20联考）某企业员工组织周末自驾游。集合后发现，如果每辆小车坐5人，则空出4个座位；如果每辆小车少坐1人，则有8人没坐上车。那么，参加自驾游的小车有：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "9辆"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "10辆"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "11辆"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "12辆"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          37
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          31
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-04-p037.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（三） · 实战精刷4 · 讲义第31页",
            "pdfPage": 37
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-04-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s03-t03-drill-04",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先设小车n辆。每辆5人时空4座，实际人数5n-4；每辆4人时有8人坐不上，实际人数4n+8。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "5n-4=4n+8\\Rightarrow n=12"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "实际人数56，12车按5座可坐60人空4座，按4人可坐48人余8人，完全满足，选D。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "空座是从总容量减，坐不上是往已坐人数加，符号别写反。"
        }
      ],
